5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Since we're updating our arrangement, I think we should be thorough. I'd like to see the actual usage patterns and how other houses handle this.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mio,,I agree! I want to know if there's an easier way to do the math so it doesn't take forever every month.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I am interested in whether the current split is actually fair, or if some of us are indeed subsidizing others.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I believe we need to understand the annual fluctuations and any potential costs associated with changing our system before we decide.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minato,,I just want us to stop being grumpy with each other about money. I want to see why people get upset.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Mio, a template might help with the time issue. I'll look into that and the habits of houses that pay ahead.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mio,,That sounds great! I'll check out the reconciliation template and how another house does their monthly settle.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I will look into the plug-in monitor readings and the payment log to see where the friction lies.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Victoria,,I'll examine the last twelve utility statements and the electrician's quote for the rooms.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minato,,"I'll look at the payment log too, and maybe that kitchen notice about the cooler.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
