31,2,,status,Mio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
32,2,,status,Benjamin,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
33,2,,status,Jonathan,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
34,2,,status,Minato,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It seems a fixed seasonal rate removes the anxiety of every single switch, though a reconciliation template is quite tedious to manage.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mio,,"I found out that even with meters or templates, it's still a lot of work! One house spent forty minutes just on the monthly settle.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The monitor shows a huge gap in usage—some use four times more than others. Also, the payment log shows we're already struggling with disputes.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The bills vary wildly; February is triple August. Also, installing individual meters would be quite expensive up front—34,000 yen per room.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minato,,The payment log shows people pay late when they're confused. And some people would rather be hot than argue about the cooler.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Victoria, given the cost of meters and the volatility of the bills, a flat share might be too unstable for some.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mio,,"If meters take forty minutes a month to manage, I'm not sure I want that. Who is going to do all that work?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Benjamin, a flat share ignores the fact that some of us use four times more electricity. That's exactly why the rumors start.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"I agree with Jonathan. A simple flat share doesn't solve the ""second rent"" feeling in winter, nor the unfairness of usage.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minato,,I don't like that we argue. Maybe we should pick the one that makes us stop questioning each other's honesty?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"A seasonal fixed rate could provide the stability Victoria wants and the freedom I crave, while avoiding the monthly math Mio hates.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mio,,But does a fixed rate solve the fairness problem Jonathan mentioned? Or does it just hide it until the end of the year?,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"It hides it, but it stops the monthly bickering. However, per-room metering is the only way to be truly objective.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"Metering is objective, but the installation cost is a significant barrier. We'd be paying a lot of money just to start the system.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minato,,"If we have meters, will we still be mean to each other? Or will we just argue about the meters?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minato, objectivity usually reduces accusations. But @Mio is right; the administrative burden of meters is high.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Mio,,Exactly! I don't want to spend my evenings keying in invoices or reading meters for forty minutes.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"If we can't afford meters now, perhaps a flat share is the simplest, even if it's not perfectly fair.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"A flat share is too volatile. The difference between summer and winter is too extreme to just ""absorb"" monthly.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minato,,I think we should pick the one that feels the most peaceful for everyone.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
